-hidden\"><div class=\"absolute inset-0 mesh-section-alt\"></div><div class=\"relative z-10 max-w-[1440px] mx-auto\"><div><div class=\"text-center mb-16 max-w-2xl mx-auto\"><span class=\"tag-premium mb-4 inline-block\">Why CrickPro</span><h2 class=\"font-display text-4xl md:text-5xl font-extrabold tracking-tight\"><span class=\"text-gradient-premium\">Built for cricket. Built to last.</span></h2><p class=\"text-text-secondary text-lg mt-4\">Six reasons leagues, clubs, and channels pick CrickPro over generic sports software.</p></div></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-5\"><div><div class=\"group relative h-full p-7 rounded-2xl border border-border/60 hover:border-foreground/20 bg-background transition-all duration-300 hover:shadow-premium-lg hover:-translate-y-1\"><div class=\"flex items-start justify-between mb-5\"><span class=\"inline-flex h-11 w-11 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-br from-zinc-100 to-zinc-50 text-zinc-700 ring-1 ring-zinc-200/70\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-layers h-5 w-5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12.83 2.18a2 2 0 0 0-1.66 0L2.6 6.08a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.83l8.58 3.91a2 2 0 0 0 1.66 0l8.58-3.9a1 1 0 0 0 0-1.83z\"></path><path d=\"M2 12a1 1 0 0 0 .58.91l8.6 3.91a2 2 0 0 0 1.65 0l8.58-3.9A1 1 0 0 0 22 12\"></path><path d=\"M2 17a1 1 0 0 0 .58.91l8.6 3.91a2 2 0 0 0 1.65 0l8.58-3.9A1 1 0 0 0 22 17\"></path></svg></span><span class=\"rounded-full bg-emerald-50 px-2.5 py-0.5 text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-emerald-700 ring-1 ring-emerald-200\">1 platform</span></div><h3 class=\"font-display text-base font-bold text-foreground mb-2\">All-in-one platform</h3><p class=\"text-text-secondary text-sm leading-relaxed\">Score, stream, overlay, and manage — no juggling multiple tools, no data duplication.</p></div></div><div><div class=\"group relative h-full p-7 rounded-2xl border border-border/60 hover:border-foreground/20 bg-background transition-all duration-300 hover:shadow-premium-lg hover:-translate-y-1\"><div class=\"flex items-start justify-between mb-5\"><span class=\"inline-flex h-11 w-11 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-br from-zinc-100 to-zinc-50 text-zinc-700 ring-1 ring-zinc-200/70\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-tv h-5 w-5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m17 2-5 5-5-5\"></path><rect width=\"20\" height=\"15\" x=\"2\" y=\"7\" rx=\"2\"></rect></svg></span><span class=\"rounded-full bg-emerald-50 px-2.5 py-0.5 text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-emerald-700 ring-1 ring-emerald-200\">TV-grade</span></div><h3 class=\"font-display text-base font-bold text-foreground mb-2\">Broadcast quality</h3><p class=\"text-text-secondary text-sm leading-relaxed\">The same overlay quality you see on professional television cricket — runs on any production rig.</p></div></div><div><div class=\"group relative h-full p-7 rounded-2xl border border-border/60 hover:border-foreground/20 bg-background transition-all duration-300 hover:shadow-premium-lg hover:-translate-y-1\"><div class=\"flex items-start justify-between mb-5\"><span class=\"inline-flex h-11 w-11 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-br from-zinc-100 to-zinc-50 text-zinc-700 ring-1 ring-zinc-200/70\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-wand-sparkles h-5 w-5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m21.64 3.64-1.28-1.28a1.21 1.21 0 0 0-1.72 0L2.36 18.64a1.21 1.21 0 0 0 0 1.72l1.28 1.28a1.2 1.2 0 0 0 1.72 0L21.64 5.36a1.2 1.2 0 0 0 0-1.72\"></path><path d=\"m14 7 3 3\"></path><path d=\"M5 6v4\"></path><path d=\"M19 14v4\"></path><path d=\"M10 2v2\"></path><path d=\"M7 8H3\"></path><path d=\"M21 16h-4\"></path><path d=\"M11 3H9\"></path></svg></span><span class=\"rounded-full bg-emerald-50 px-2.5 py-0.5 text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-emerald-700 ring-1 ring-emerald-200\">Visual builder</span></div><h3 class=\"font-display text-base font-bold text-foreground mb-2\">No coding required</h3><p class=\"text-text-secondary text-sm leading-relaxed\">Websites, overlays, and streaming — all configured visually. Drag, drop, publish.</p></div></div><div><div class=\"group relative h-full p-7 rounded-2xl border border-border/60 hover:border-foreground/20 bg-background transition-all duration-300 hover:shadow-premium-lg hover:-translate-y-1\"><div class=\"flex items-start justify-between mb-5\"><span class=\"inline-flex h-11 w-11 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-br from-zinc-100 to-zinc-50 text-zinc-700 ring-1 ring-zinc-200/70\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-globe h-5 w-5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"M12 2a14.5 14.5 0 0 0 0 20 14.5 14.5 0 0 0 0-20\"></path><path d=\"M2 12h20\"></path></svg></span><span class=\"rounded-full bg-emerald-50 px-2.5 py-0.5 text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-emerald-700 ring-1 ring-emerald-200\">All formats</span></div><h3 class=\"font-display text-base font-bold text-foreground mb-2\">Every cricket format</h3><p class=\"text-text-secondary text-sm leading-relaxed\">T5 to Test matches, indoor to outdoor, tape-ball to leather, Hundred to Pair — one platform handles it.</p></div></div><div><div class=\"group relative h-full p-7 rounded-2xl border border-border/60 hover:border-foreground/20 bg-background transition-all duration-300 hover:shadow-premium-lg hover:-translate-y-1\"><div class=\"flex items-start justify-between mb-5\"><span class=\"inline-flex h-11 w-11 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-br from-zinc-100 to-zinc-50 text-zinc-700 ring-1 ring-zinc-200/70\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-activity h-5 w-5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M22 12h-2.48a2 2 0 0 0-1.93 1.46l-2.35 8.36a.25.25 0 0 1-.48 0L9.24 2.18a.25.25 0 0 0-.48 0l-2.35 8.36A2 2 0 0 1 4.49 12H2\"></path></svg></span><span class=\"rounded-full bg-emerald-50 px-2.5 py-0.5 text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-emerald-700 ring-1 ring-emerald-200\">Sub-second</span></div><h3 class=\"font-display text-base font-bold text-foreground mb-2\">Live everything</h3><p class=\"text-text-secondary text-sm leading-relaxed\">Live scores, statistics, streaming overlays, and player profiles update the second you tap.</p></div></div><div><div class=\"group relative h-full p-7 rounded-2xl border border-border/60 hover:border-foreground/20 bg-background transition-all duration-300 hover:shadow-premium-lg hover:-translate-y-1\"><div class=\"flex items-start justify-between mb-5\"><span class=\"inline-flex h-11 w-11 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-br from-zinc-100 to-zinc-50 text-zinc-700 ring-1 ring-zinc-200/70\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-wifi-off h-5 w-5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 20h.01\"></path><path d=\"M8.5 16.429a5 5 0 0 1 7 0\"></path><path d=\"M5 12.859a10 10 0 0 1 5.17-2.69\"></path><path d=\"M19 12.859a10 10 0 0 0-2.007-1.523\"></path><path d=\"M2 8.82a15 15 0 0 1 4.177-2.643\"></path><path d=\"M22 8.82a15 15 0 0 0-11.288-3.764\"></path><path d=\"m2 2 20 20\"></path></svg></span><span class=\"rounded-full bg-emerald-50 px-2.5 py-0.5 text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-emerald-700 ring-1 ring-emerald-200\">Offline-ready</span></div><h3 class=\"font-display text-base font-bold text-foreground mb-2\">Works without internet</h3><p class=\"text-text-secondary text-sm leading-relaxed\">Score matches in fields with no signal. Data syncs automatically the moment you reconnect.</p></div></div></div></div><div class=\"absolute bottom-0 left-0 right-0 section-divider\"></div></section><section class=\"max-w-[1440px] mx-auto px-6 py-12\"><div class=\"text-center mb-10 max-w-2xl mx-auto\"><span class=\"tag-premium  mb-3 inline-block\">Free Android &amp; iOS</span><h2 class=\"font-display text-3xl md:text-4xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-foreground\"><span class=\"text-gradient-premium\">Get the CrickPro apps</span></h2><p class=\"mt-3 text-base text-text-secondary\">Score on mobile, stream from your phone, and produce television-grade broadcasts on desktop — Mac and Windows.</p></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-5 max-w-5xl mx-auto\"><div class=\"rounded-2xl p-6 transition-all duration-200 bg-white ring-1 ring-zinc-200/70 hover:ring-zinc-300 hover:shadow-premium\"><div class=\"flex items-start gap-3 mb-5\"><span class=\"inline-flex h-11 w-11 items-center justify-center rounded-xl flex-shrink-0 shadow-md bg-zinc-950 !text-white\"><svg class=\"h-5 w-5\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M3.7 17.4l3-3 3 3-3 3-3-3zm6.4-6.4l5.5-5.5c.6-.6 1.5-.6 2.1 0l1.4 1.4c.6.6.6 1.5 0 2.1l-5.5 5.5-3.5-3.5zm-1.5 1.5l3.5 3.5-2.1 2.1-3.5-3.5 2.1-2.1z\"></path></svg></span><div class=\"min-w-0\"><h3 class=\"font-display text-base font-bold text-foreground\">CrickPro</h3><p class=\"text-xs text-text-secondary leading-relaxed